  "body": "## What\n\nAdd the phase 1 retrospective, checkpoint report, devlog entry, and coordinator handoff. Update the plan status, operator requirements, model assignments, phase 2 gates, retrospective index, and project history. Preserve the coordinator inputs and command outputs.\n\n## Why\n\nGive the operator an approval checkpoint and the next coordinator a verified starting point. The snapshot covers 15 phase 1 merges through #68 and the ten-PR retrospective. Boundary and testing gates remain prerequisites for phase 2.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- [Command evidence and local validation](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/tree/dedf58f/reports/inputs/phase-1-history).\n- [Coordinator inputs](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/dedf58f/reports/inputs/phase-1-coordinator-notes.md).\n- `mise run fmt`, `mise run check`, and `mise run build` passed. Vale reports zero alerts. Input and staged secret scans passed.\n- [CI check](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/actions/runs/36276606808) and [docs build and internal links](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/actions/runs/36276606841) passed. The PR-body and import guards also passed.\n- Worker: Codex documentation writer. The runtime did not expose the launch model or effort, so those fields remain unverified.\n- Follow-ups #70, #71, #72, #73, and #74 were filed and added to Project 9.\n\n## Docs\n\nAll requested checkpoint pages are included. The root HANDOFF.md pointer is unchanged. The plan changes are limited to the requested sections. Docs rendering and internal links are checked by CI because Chromium is blocked in the recorded local Codex sandbox.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] CI green: check, docs, pr-body, and imported-research.\n- [x] Docs updated.\n- [x] No secrets found in input and staged scans.\n- [x] Evidence committed.\n\nRefs: #69\n",
